ILLUSTRATIVE PLACEHOLDER - NOT A REAL PDF

This file stands in for a client collection-route list for the sample
refuse-fleet case. Step 3 does NOT parse this file. The extracted values the
demo uses live in extracted.json in this directory, labelled illustrative. This
placeholder keeps the exact file name (collection_routes.pdf) the intake flow
attaches, so the demo runs fully offline without a PDF reader.

Pretend contents (illustrative only):
  - weekday collection rounds, depart depot ~06:00, return ~15:00
  - hundreds of bin stops per round
  - every truck returns to the same depot each night
